WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:06.920
My name is Adjoa Anne Bernadette Konin.

2
00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:08.720
I like Dakar a lot.

3
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:16.680
There is a great deal of solidarity, which can’t be measured.

4
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.240
We are all together; we are one big family with children and everything.

5
00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:26.240
I am a nurse at the FANN Hospital in Dakar.

6
00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:30.600
I like this job because I like helping people.

7
00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:36.280
During the pandemic, it was really really hard

8
00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.280
for the Senegalese people. For everyone.

9
00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:46.600
We can’t forget that.

10
00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:51.360
Because we lost many people, lots of relatives, friends, neighbours.

11
00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:53.640
It had a big impact on us.

12
00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:55.920
There are a lot of people who have been vaccinated,

13
00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:59.720
but there are still others who are going around without a vaccination.

14
00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:07.360
It might be a good idea to work with the Africans and all that so that we can have more medicines.

15
00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:10.840
With that we can fight the disease.

16
00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:14.840
We can take precautions and get ahead of it.

17
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:19.000
It will be really good for me to see that.

